<title>FRANCE: Latest details of EU grain export/import balance.</title>
<headline>Latest details of EU grain export/import balance.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are details of European Union (EU) grain export/import commitments as of October 22 in the July-to-June 1996/97 campaign, supplied by member country officials.</p>
<p>On October 24, the EU additionally granted exports of 290,000 tonnes of soft wheat, 38,783 tonnes of barley, 26,180 tonnes of rye, and 20,000 tonnes of oats.</p>
<p>Figures ('000 tonnes) are based on officially communicated certificates and are subject to revision.  </p>
<p>			 ---------1996/97-------  ------1995/96-----</p>
<p>			  1 Jul96 to 22 Oct96    1 Jul95 to 22 Oct95</p>
